# Marketing-only Railway deploy (magic-sands-booking)

This repo deploys to Railway in **marketing-only** mode by default (`SITE_PROFILE=marketing`).

## What goes to Railway (this repo)

- Public marketing pages (`/`, `/about/`, `/contact/`, etc.)
- Partner registration (`/partner-register/`)
- Marketing CMS (`/admin/marketing/`)

## What does NOT go to this Railway service

- Hotel search / checkout (`/hotels/`, `/book/`) → separate booking Git + Railway
- Partner login / portal (`/partner-login/`, `/partner/`) → booking service
- Enterprise admin / vouchers → **voucher-system** repo → `portal.magicsandsdmc.com`

## After finishing marketing work

1. **Commit** relevant changes in `magic-sands-booking` (not voucher-system).
2. **Push** to `origin/main` on **magic-sands-marketingsite** so the marketing Railway redeploys.
3. Do **not** push booking-only changes to the marketing Railway — those belong in the future booking repo.
4. Set `PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL` on Railway to the booking domain when that service exists.

Local dev on port **8001** runs the full stack unless `SITE_PROFILE=marketing`.

See `DEPLOY.md` and `ARCHITECTURE.md` in this repo.
